title: "Stitch Export"
abstract: "Stitch Export is a free, open-source Chrome extension for Google Stitch that exports every project — screens, images, design systems and the full chat history — to ZIP archives and LLM-ready JSON (Claude, ChatGPT), locally in your browser."
